          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the macOS system is configured to disable NFS service with the following command:

/bin/launchctl print-disabled system | /usr/bin/grep -c '"com.apple.nfsd" =&gt; disabled'

If the result is not "1", this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
