          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the macOS system to disable the iCloud Private Relay by installing the "com.apple.applicationaccess" configuration profile.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
