          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the macOS system is configured to disable Unlock with Apple Watch during Setup Assistant with the following command:

/usr/bin/osascript -l JavaScript &lt;&lt; EOS
$.NSUserDefaults.alloc.initWithSuiteName('com.apple.SetupAssistant.managed')\
.objectForKey('SkipUnlockWithWatch').js
EOS

If the result is not "true", this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
