          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Apple Intelligence features that use off-device Artificial Intelligence (AI) must be disabled.

Use of off-device AI poses a data loss risk.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
        </STIG_DATA>
        <STIG_DATA>
