          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>iPhone Mirroring must be disabled to prevent file transfers to or from unauthorized devices. 

Disabling iPhone Mirroring also prevents potentially unauthorized applications from appearing as if they are installed on the Mac.

Satisfies: SRG-OS-000080-GPOS-00048, SRG-OS-000095-GPOS-00049, SRG-OS-000300-GPOS-00118</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
